    "scope": "The museum’s identity and connected outer shape are established by named OpenStreetMap way 491583514. Separate mapped outlines control the Green Dome, fountain, small historic tombs and the lodge’s kitchen and cells. A published architectural survey checks the 30.5 m square mausoleum core and 68 m by 84 m courtyard."
