  "note": "Türkiye’s restoration record documents the 16 turquoise-tiled lobes of the tomb tower. The museum’s former director identifies the 18 dervish cells, the semahane and mosque, and the location of its single-balconied minaret. Qualla’s cleared exact original shows the fluted Green Dome, lead domes, single minaret and dressed stone."
